<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Welcome to SAHAYOG</title>

<style>

* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg,#071b33,#075985,#087f8c);
    color: white;
}

.welcome {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 25px;
}

.box {
    max-width: 650px;
    width: 100%;
}

.logo {
    font-size: 55px;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
}

.brand {
    font-size: 40px;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 5px;
}

.tagline {
    color: #a5f3fc;
    font-size: 14px;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
}

h1 {
    font-size: 35px;
    margin-top: 45px;
}

.description {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #e0f2fe;
    margin: 20px 0;
}

.highlight {
    color: #fde68a;
    font-weight: bold;
}

.buttons {
    margin-top: 35px;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 15px;
}

button {
    padding: 15px 25px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 30px;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: bold;
    cursor: pointer;
}

.start {
    background: #facc15;
    color: #102a43;
}

.job {
    background: white;
    color: #075985;
}

.company {
    background: transparent;
    color: white;
    border: 2px solid white;
}

.quote {
    margin-top: 45px;
    font-size: 16px;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #fde68a;
}

footer {
    margin-top: 35px;
    color: #bae6fd;
    font-size: 12px;
}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="welcome">

<div class="box">

<div class="logo">🤝</div>

<div class="brand">SAHAYOG</div>

<div class="tagline">
CONNECTING PEOPLE • CREATING OPPORTUNITIES
</div>

<h1>Welcome to SAHAYOG!</h1>

<p class="description">

A warm welcome to <span class="highlight">SAHAYOG</span>!

We believe that every person has a talent
and every company needs skilled people.

Our mission is to connect companies with
talented workers and help people discover
new job opportunities.

Together, we can build a better future
through skills, hard work and opportunities.

</p>

<p class="highlight">
Your Skills. Your Opportunities. Your Future.
</p>

<div class="buttons">

<button class="start" onclick="startApp()">
GET STARTED →
</button>

<button class="job" onclick="openWorker()">
FIND A JOB
</button>

<button class="company" onclick="openCompany()">
REGISTER COMPANY
</button>

</div>

<div class="quote">

"Together We Work, Together We Grow!"

</div>

<footer>
© 2026 SAHAYOG | A Platform For Everyone
</footer>

</div>
</div>

<script>

function startApp() {
    alert("Welcome to SAHAYOG! Let's get started.");
}

function openWorker() {
    alert("Welcome! Please open Job Seeker Registration.");
}

function openCompany() {
    alert("Welcome! Please open Company Registration.");
}

</script>

</body>
</html>
